    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-010-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE",
      "slug": "eng-a1-010-present-simple-affirmative",
      "sortOrder": 10,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-009-HAVE-HAS"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Present Simple: tasdiq gaplar",
        "description": "Kundalik ish-harakatlar; he/she/it uchun -s.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu darsda **Present Simple** (hozirgi oddiy zamon) tasdiq gaplarini o'rganasiz — kundalik odatlar va faktlarni ifodalash uchun." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Present Simple kundalik odat va faktlar uchun ishlatiladi.\n\n- **I / you / we / they** bilan fe'l o'zgarmaydi: I **work**, they **live**.\n- **he / she / it** bilan fe'lga **-s** qo'shiladi: he **works**, she **lives**.\n\nAyrim fe'llarda yozilishi biroz o'zgaradi:\n\n- study → **studies** (undosh + y → -ies)\n- go → **goes**, watch → **watches** (-o, -ch, -sh dan keyin -es)" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- I **work** in an office.\n- We **live** in a small town.\n- He **lives** in Tashkent.\n- She **studies** English every day.\n- My father **works** in a school." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "She ___ English every day.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "study" }, { "id": "b", "text": "studies" }, { "id": "c", "text": "studys" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Ko'p uchraydigan xato:** *he / she / it* bilan fe'lga **-s** ni unutmang, lekin yozilishiga e'tibor bering.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *He work in a bank.* → To'g'ri: **He works in a bank.**\n- Noto'g'ri: *She studys English.* → To'g'ri: **She studies English.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "He ___ in a bank. (work)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "work" }, { "id": "b", "text": "works" }, { "id": "c", "text": "working" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I ___ in Samarkand. (live)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "live" }, { "id": "b", "text": "lives" }, { "id": "c", "text": "living" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "My sister ___ in a hospital. (work)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "work" }, { "id": "b", "text": "works" }, { "id": "c", "text": "is work" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-011-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE",
      "slug": "eng-a1-011-present-simple-negative",
      "sortOrder": 20,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE", "ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
