      "revision": {
        "title": "Present Simple: inkor gaplar",
        "description": "don't / doesn't; doesn't dan keyin asosiy fe'l.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu darsda Present Simple **inkor** gaplarini o'rganasiz: *don't* va *doesn't* yordamida biror ish qilinmasligini aytish." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Inkor uchun **don't** yoki **doesn't** ishlatiladi:\n\n- **I / you / we / they** → **don't** + asosiy fe'l\n- **he / she / it** → **doesn't** + asosiy fe'l\n\n**Eng muhim qoida:** *doesn't* dan keyin fe'l **asosiy shakl**da bo'ladi (-s **qo'shilmaydi**).\n\n- To'g'ri: **doesn't work**\n- Noto'g'ri: *doesn't works*\n\nSababi: -s allaqachon *does* ichida bor." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- I **don't work** on Sunday.\n- We **don't live** here.\n- She **doesn't drink** coffee.\n- He **doesn't like** tea.\n- They **don't study** on Saturday." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "She ___ coffee. (drink, inkor)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "don't drink" }, { "id": "b", "text": "doesn't drink" }, { "id": "c", "text": "doesn't drinks" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Ko'p uchraydigan xato:** *doesn't* dan keyin fe'lga **-s** qo'shmang.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *She doesn't works.*\n- To'g'ri: **She doesn't work.**\n\nShuningdek, *he / she / it* bilan **don't** emas, **doesn't** ishlatiladi.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *He don't like tea.*\n- To'g'ri: **He doesn't like tea.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I ___ on Sunday. (work, inkor)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "don't work" }, { "id": "b", "text": "doesn't work" }, { "id": "c", "text": "don't works" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "He ___ tea. (like, inkor)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "doesn't likes" }, { "id": "b", "text": "doesn't like" }, { "id": "c", "text": "don't like" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "They ___ in Tashkent. (live, inkor)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "doesn't live" }, { "id": "b", "text": "don't live" }, { "id": "c", "text": "don't lives" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          }
        ]
      }
