    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-012-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS",
      "slug": "eng-a1-012-present-simple-questions",
      "sortOrder": 30,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS", "ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE", "ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-011-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Present Simple: savollar va yakuniy takrorlash",
        "description": "Do / Does savollari, qisqa javoblar va A1 pilotining yakuniy takrori.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Maqsad\n\nBu — yakuniy dars. Present Simple **savollari**ni o'rganasiz va shu bilan birga butun A1 pilotning asosiy mavzularini qisqacha eslaymiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "Present Simple savollari **Do / Does** bilan boshlanadi:\n\n- **I / you / we / they** → **Do** + ega + asosiy fe'l: *Do you work here?*\n- **he / she / it** → **Does** + ega + asosiy fe'l: *Does she live here?*\n\n**Qisqa javoblar:**\n\n- Do you ...? → **Yes, I do.** / **No, I don't.**\n- Does he ...? → **Yes, he does.** / **No, he doesn't.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **A:** Do you speak English? **B:** Yes, I do.\n- **A:** Does she live in Tashkent? **B:** No, she doesn't.\n- **A:** Do they study on Sunday? **B:** No, they don't.\n- **A:** Does he like coffee? **B:** Yes, he does." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ he like tea?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Do" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Does" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Is" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "**Yakuniy takrorlash — A1 pilotning asosiy mavzulari:**\n\n- **to be:** I am, she is, they are; inkor: isn't / aren't; savol: Are you ...?\n- **Shaxsiy ma'lumot:** I am 20 years old. I am from Uzbekistan.\n- **Egalik va oila:** my, his, her; mother, father, brother, sister.\n- **have / has:** I have a brother. She has a car.\n- **Present Simple:** He works. She doesn't work. Do you work?\n\n**Diqqat:** *Does / doesn't* dan keyin fe'l asosiy shaklda bo'ladi.\n\n- Noto'g'ri: *Does he works?* → To'g'ri: **Does he work?**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ you live in Tashkent?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Do" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Does" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Are" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS", "ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Does she ___ English? — bo'sh joyga qaysi to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "speak" }, { "id": "b", "text": "speaks" }, { "id": "c", "text": "speaking" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS", "ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "\"Does he work here?\" savoliga qisqa inkor javob qaysi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "No, he doesn't." }, { "id": "b", "text": "No, he don't." }, { "id": "c", "text": "No, he isn't." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
